      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are proud to present 149 Cappaghmore, Clondalkin to the market—a truly exceptional family home that has been finished to an impeccable standard throughout. Beautifully renovated and thoughtfully redesigned, this impressive three-bedroom semi-detached residence extends to approximately 137 Sqm and offers the perfect balance of contemporary style, generous living space and everyday practicality. Situated within one of Clondalkin's most established and sought-after residential developments, the property enjoys an enviable location just moments from the village centre and an excellent selection of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities. \r\n\r\nOriginally constructed as a four-bedroom home, the current owners have reconfigured the first floor to create three bedrooms, complemented by a luxurious family bathroom. Further enhancing the property's appeal, full planning permission has been secured to extend over the garage and convert the attic, offering superb potential for future expansion.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and elegant entrance hall with guest WC, setting the tone for the quality that continues throughout the home. The heart of the property is a magnificent open-plan living and dining area, flooded with natural light and beautifully finished with stylish interiors, quality flooring and a contemporary gas stove, creating a warm yet sophisticated space for both everyday family living and entertaining. The stunning bespoke kitchen has been thoughtfully designed with both functionality and style in mind, offering an abundance of storage and workspace. Sliding doors provide a seamless connection to the beautifully maintained rear garden, while a practical pantry leads to a separate laundry room, adding further convenience.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. The private rear garden has been designed for low-maintenance living and features two stylish patio areas, creating the ideal setting for outdoor dining and summer entertaining. To the front, electronic gates provide enhanced privacy and security, while the stone-finished driveway offers ample off-street parking. Combining exceptional presentation, outstanding quality and significant future potential, 149 Cappaghmore represents a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey family home in one of Clondalkin's most desirable residential locations. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended, contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today. \r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nBer E1 (rating prior to all renovations and upgrades, will be substantially higher now)\r\nc. 137 Sqm\r\nElectric gated driveway to front with car charger point\r\nFull planning permission for attic conversion and extension\r\nComplete rewiring throughout\r\nNew plumbing throughout\r\nLuxurious family bathroom\r\nContemporary fitted kitchen\r\nComposite windows and doors throughout\r\nBespoke fitted wardrobes\r\nNew flooring throughout, including elegant herringbone flooring at ground floor level\r\nComprehensive insulation to floors, walls and ceilings\r\nNew gas-fired central heating system\r\n\r\nDirections \r\nHeading out of Clondalkin village, head towards the Ninth Lock. Go over the bridge and just after the traffic light junction of at Station Road. Roughly 100m on your left hand side you will find the entrance to the Cappaghmore development. ."
      },
